(Indoor Air Quality and Air Purification Protocols) Tj T*

(Document ID: REF-IND-2024) Tj T*
(Source: Indoor Air Protection Bureau) Tj T*
(Topic: HEPA Air Purifiers, Ventilation, and Indoor Source Management) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Indoor Protection Strategies:) Tj T*
(1. Filtration Standards: Use True HEPA air purifiers \(H13 or H14 rated\) capturing 99.97% of particles down to 0.3 microns.) Tj T*
(2. Recirculation Mode: Set HVAC systems to internal recirculation during outdoor pollution spikes.) Tj T*
(3. Sealing Protocols: Close windows, external doors, and fireplace dampers when outdoor AQI exceeds 100.) Tj T*
(4. Indoor Source Avoidance: Do not burn candles, incense, or wood during high outdoor pollution events.) Tj T*
(5. MERV Ratings: Install MERV 13 or higher filters in central HVAC heating and cooling systems.) Tj T*
ET
